### 42.2 Would Tim's parents be pleased or not if their son's teacher told them the following?
1. Tim was playing up in class last week. {__}
2. Tim messed up his homework. {__}
3. Tim has been helping a classmate who has fallen behind. {__}
4. Tim has caught up with the rest of the class. Tim didn't hand in his homework. Tim missed out some important work. {__}

